Number os possible hinges, [latex]n=2[/latex] Statical Indeterminacy, [latex]r=1[/latex] Number of independent mechanisms, [latex]i=n-r=2-1=1[/latex] [latex]\begin{aligned}
    \Delta &=7\theta =3\phi\\ \text{By principle of virtual work,}&\text{ we get,}\\ W\times \Delta -M_{P}\theta -M_{P}\left ( \theta +\phi \right )&=0 \\ W\times 7\theta &=2M_{P}\theta +M_{P}\phi \\ W\times 7\theta &=2M_{P}\theta +M_{P}\times \frac{7\theta }{3} \\  7W&=\frac{6M_{P}+7M_{P}}{3} \\ W&=\frac{13M_{P}}{21}
\end{aligned}[/latex]

